<title>JAPAN: Showa Aircraft - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Showa Aircraft - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.74		vs	   22.54</p>
<p> Operating	   63 million	 vs	  413 million</p>
<p> Current	     74 million	 vs	  388 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 147 million	 vs   prft 246 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 4.38 yen	  vs     prft 7.33 yen</p>
<p> Shares		34 million	 vs	   34 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Showa Aircraft Industry Co Ltd is a truck assembler and maker of some aircraft equipment.</p>
</text>
